      "description": "University of the Incarnate Word - Cardinal Talent | Search Jobs Skip to Main Content Cardinal Talent Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help UIW Home UIW Strategic Priorities Visit UIW Search  Postings (180) Hide Search Options View all open Postings below, or enter search criteria to narrow your search. Keywords Posted Within Any time period Last Day Last Week Last Month Department No Selection Academic Advising Academic Affairs & Provost, VP Office Accounts Payable Admissions Advancement Services Alumni Relations Annual Giving Athletics Auxiliary Academic Services Behavioral Health Business Office Campus Engagement Campus Life Career Services College of Humanities, Arts & Social Sciences Communications & Brand Marketing Comptroller's Office Customer Experience Development Digital Infrastructure, Operations, & Security Digital Strategy & Marketing Digital Transformation & Innovation Dreeben School of Education Enrollment Management & Student Experience Enrollment Services Enterprise Applications Environmental Health, Safety, Risk Management Ettling Center for Civic Leadership & Sustainab... External Relations, VP Office Facilities Events Management Facilities Management Feik School of Pharmacy Finance & Administrative Services, VP Office Financial Assistance Foundation & Corporate Relations Grants Accounting Graphic Design & Printing Services HEB School of Business and Administration Health Services Human Resources ILA Faye Miller School of Nursing & Health Prof Institute of the Americas Institutional Effectiveness Institutional Research International Admissions & Recruiting International Affairs, VP Office International Students & Scholar Services Learning Support Center Legal Affairs & General Counsel, Office of Library Services Library Technical Services Military & Veteran Affairs Mission & Ministry, VP Office New Student Programs Office of External Relations Office of Finance & Administrative Services Office of Innovation and Technology/CIO Office of International Affairs Office of Legal Affairs & General Counsel Office of Mission & Ministry Office of Strategy & Enrollment Office of the Provost Payroll Planning & Campus Facilities Management Postal Operations President, Office of Procurement & Other Support Services Registrar Research & Graduate Education Residence Life & Housing Operations Rosenberg School of Optometry School of Mathematics, Science & Engineering School of Media & Design School of Osteopathic Medicine School of Professional Studies School of Rehabilitation Sciences Shipping & Receiving Sports & Wellness St. Anthony Catholic High School Strategy & Enrollment, VP Office Student Advocacy & Accountability Student Disability Services Student Success TRIO-Student Success Teaching, Learning, & Technology Teaching, Learning, & Technology Office Testing Services Title IX University Police Vehicle Operations Web & Mobile Operations Job Title Position Type No Selection Administrator / Staff High School Positions University Faculty Student Executive Positions Previous 1 2 3 4 5 6 Next View Results (180\n    ) Posting Number Department Postion Type Job Close Date Track and Field Graduate Assistant for Sprints/Distance STU1686PO Athletics Student 05/15/2027 The Graduate Assistant provides support to the Head Coach in all aspects of academic success, coaching, strength, conditioning, recruiting, planning of practice, organization of team meetings, scheduling and trip management. The Graduate Assistant reports to the Head Track and Field Coach. This is a student position open to current UIW grauate students. View Details Bookmark Graduate Assistant -  UMM Media Ministry STU1685PO Office of Mission & Ministry Student 05/15/2027 The Graduate Assistant for UMM Media Ministry assists in producing and archiving various media for the promotion of events that support the mission of the university. Position will also assist in the mentoring and supervision of undergraduate Media Ministry Interns and volunteers. The Graduate Assistant for UMM Media Ministry reports to Director of Music Ministries and Liturgy. This is a studen... View Details Bookmark Graduate Student Worker for Institutional Research STU1680PO Institutional Research Student The IR Graduate Student Worker will support the staff of the Office of Institutional Research with the completion of various projects which may include general surveys, the Institutional Profile Book, the maintenance of the electronic records, and other special data analysis projects. View Details Bookmark Student Music Minister STU1639PO Office of Mission & Ministry Student The Student Music Minister is part of a team that serves at the 11 AM Mass as a member of and musical leader for the Laudate Choir. As a leadership team member of the Music Ministry, the Music Minister also serves at major university liturgies and prayer events sponsored by University Mission and Ministry. View Details Bookmark Parking Services Liaison-PT AS2312PO University Police Administrator / Staff The Parking Services Liaison enforces traffic and parking regulations, assists in special events, and reports all irregularities, emergencies, or suspicious activity to the University Police Department. The Parking Services Liaison will report to the University Police Lieutenant.This is a part-time position that works 29 hours per week for 10 months out of the year. View Details Bookmark IT Project Manager/Business Analyst AS2298PO Digital Transformation & Innovation Administrator / Staff The IT Project Manager/Business Analyst is responsible for collaborating with cross-functional and technical teams across domestic and international UIW sites to facilitate business analysis and management of project activities. Key responsibilities include managing project operations to support the successful implementation of technological processes and/or system improvements. The IT Project ... View Details Bookmark Administrative Coordinator-Unified In Wellness (Part Time) AS2311PO Office of the Provost Administrator / Staff The Administrative Coordinator-Unified In Wellness (PT) is responsible for providing administrative support for the Unified-In-Wellness program to ensure all daily procedures run smoothly. The Administrative Coordinator-Unified In Wellness (PT) reports to the Associate Provost for HP Initiatives and Partnerships. View Details Bookmark Student Assistant for Admissions Processing STU1682PO Admissions Student 05/15/2027 The Student Assistant for Admissions Processing assists the processing specialists with all tasks, processes, and documents received as part of a student application. This position reports to the Assistant Director of Admissions Processing.This is a student position open to current UIW students who may be hired through the Federal Work-Study Program or student employment. View Details Bookmark Graduate Assistant- Admissions Processor STU1681PO Admissions Student 05/15/2027 The Student Assistant for Admissions Processing assists the processing specialists with all tasks, processes, and documents received as part of a student application. This position reports to the Assistant Director of Admissions Processing. View Details Bookmark Student Library Assistant for School of Osteopathic Medicine (Brooks Campus) STU1571PO Library Services Student The Student Assistant for School of Osteopathic Medicine (Brooks Campus) is responsible for providing basic circulation assistance. The Student Assistant reports to the Director of Library Services. View Details Bookmark Assistant Women's Tennis Coach AS2276PO Athletics Administrator / Staff The Assistant Women’s Tennis Coach supports the Head Coach and Director of Tennis in all aspects of operating a competitive NCAA Division I Women’s tennis program. The position plays a key role in fostering a culture of accountability, development, and competitive excellence consistent with UIW’s mission and Southland Conference standards. The Assistant Women’s Tennis Coach reports to the Head ... View Details Bookmark Program Coordinator-Artful Worship Grant AS2309PO College of Humanities, Arts & Social Sciences Administrator / Staff The Program Coordinator-Artful Worship Grant provides full-time coordination and operational leadership for Artful Worship: Inspiring Children’s Faith Through the Catholic Imagination, a multi-year Lilly Endowment initiative exploring how literature, music, visual art, storytelling, and the creative imagination nurture children’s faith. The Program Coordinator-Artful Worship Grant reports to th... View Details Bookmark Theatre Technician (Student Position) STU1675PO College of Humanities, Arts & Social Sciences Student Theatre technicians provide technical production support and assist in the preparation of performance spaces for the Theatre Arts Department’s production season.This applicant pool will remain online and be used to hire interested UIW students as the need arises.This is a student position open to current UIW students who may be hired through the Federal Work-Study Program or student employment. View Details Bookmark Pharmacy Student Affairs Assistant- Workstudy Student STU1677PO Feik School of Pharmacy Student 05/15/2027 The Pharmacy Student Affairs Assistant support the office functions within the Feik School of Pharmacy Office of Student Affairs.This position is funded by the Federal Work-Study program and is open to UIW students who are approved and eligible to participate in the Federal Work-Study Program. View Details Bookmark Student Assistant for Financial Assistance (Work-Study) STU1678PO Financial Assistance Student 05/15/2027 The student assistant will assist the Office of Financial Assistance with the efficient daily operations of the department. This position reports to the Financial Assistant Advisor.This position is funded by the Federal Work-Study program and is open to UIW students who are approved and eligible to participate in the Federal Work-Study Program. Note that students can work a maximum of 20 hours ... View Details Bookmark Director of Advancement-St. Anthony Catholic High School HS418PO St. Anthony Catholic High School High School Positions The Director of Advancement for St. Anthony Catholic High School (SACHS) provides leadership and strategy in advancement efforts which are in line with the Catholic mission of SACHS. Specifically, position is responsible for implementing and maintaining a comprehensive advancement program to include oversight of all fundraising, volunteer coordination, marketing, communications, and alumni rela... View Details Bookmark Writing & Learning Center Program Leader AS2307PO Learning Support Center Administrator / Staff The Writing and Learning Center (WLC) Program Leader is responsible for managing the daily operations of the Writing and Learning Center. The WLC Program Leader reports to the Director of Learning Support Services. View Details Bookmark Military and Veterans Services Specialist & School Certifying Official AS2305PO Military & Veteran Affairs Administrator / Staff The Military and Veteran Services Specialist & School Certifying Official serves as a primary point of contact for military-affiliated students at UIW, providing exceptional customer service and administering U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs (VA), Department of Defense (DoD) Tuition Assistance, and other educational benefits. The Military and Veteran Services Specialist & School Cert... View Details Bookmark Lecturer in Economics UN1052PO HEB School of Business and Administration University Faculty 03/30/2027 The Department of Economics invites part-time faculty candidates for Lecturer in Economics within the H-E-B School of Business and Administration. This faculty position will teach undergraduate and/or graduate courses in economics. In all matters, faculty are expected to maintain the highest standards of professional ethics consistent with the UIW Mission. Official duties and responsibilities o... View Details Bookmark Human Resources Workstudy Assistant STU1599PO Human Resources Student 05/15/2027 The Human Resources Workstudy Assistant will assist staff within the Human Resources Office on various daily and long term processes. The Human Resources Workstudy Assistant will report to the Human Resources Generalist.This position is funded by the Federal Work-Study program and is open to UIW students who are approved and eligible to participate in the Federal Work-Study Program. View Details Bookmark Business Operations Manager AS2304PO ILA Faye Miller School of Nursing & Health Prof Administrator / Staff The Business Operations Manager serves as a key member of the School of Nursing and Health Professions (SNHP) team and supports the Dean in overseeing the school’s financial, operational, and administrative activities, as well as collaborates with program chairs, directors, and faculty as appropriate. This position is responsible for budget planning and monitoring, operational coordination, com... View Details Bookmark High School Counselor HS419PO St. Anthony Catholic High School High School Positions St. Anthony Catholic High School, a private, college preparatory High school for young men and women, is seeking a High School Counselor. The Counselor is responsible for supporting all St. Anthony Catholic High School (SACHS) students in their social, emotional, academic, college, and career development. Position will ensure students receive the courses required to meet graduation requirements... View Details Bookmark Lecturer in Finance-SPS UN1045PO School of Professional Studies University Faculty The School of Professional Studies invites part-time faculty candidates for Lecturer in Finance. In all matters, faculty are expected to maintain the highest standards of professional ethics consistent with the UIW Mission. Official duties and responsibilities of part-time faculty members at the University include teaching and professional activities as assigned. This applicant pool will remain... View Details Bookmark Lecturer in Communications-SPS UN1042PO School of Professional Studies University Faculty The School of Professional Studies invites part-time faculty candidates for Lecturer in Communications. In all matters, faculty are expected to maintain the highest standards of professional ethics consistent with the UIW Mission. Official duties and responsibilities of part-time faculty members at the University include teaching and professional activities as assigned.This applicant pool will ... View Details Bookmark Lecturer Criminal Justice-SPS UN1035PO School of Professional Studies University Faculty 04/30/2027 The School of Professional Studies invites part-time faculty candidates for Lecturer, Criminal Justice. In all matters, faculty are expected to maintain the highest standards of professional ethics consistent with the UIW Mission. Official duties and responsibilities of faculty members at the University include teaching and professional activities as assigned.This applicant pool will remain onl... View Details Bookmark Lecturer in Biology-SPS UN1049PO School of Professional Studies University Faculty 03/30/2027 The School of Professional Studies invites part-time faculty candidates for Lecturer in Biology. In all matters, faculty are expected to maintain the highest standards of professional ethics consistent with the UIW Mission. Official duties and responsibilities of part-time faculty members at the University include teaching and professional activities as assigned.This applicant pool will remain ... View Details Bookmark Systems Analyst/Programmer AS2299PO Enterprise Applications Administrator / Staff The Systems Analyst/Programmer is responsible for providing support in maintaining academic and student-facing platforms, including learning management, CRM, and student advising systems. The Systems Analyst/Programmer reports to the Associate Director of Enterprise Support. View Details Bookmark Teacher Certification Officer/Assessment Coordinator AS2308PO Dreeben School of Education Administrator / Staff The Teacher Certification Officer/Assessment Coordinator is a full-time administrative position with the responsibility of managing the educator certification program of the Dreeben School of Education. The Teacher Certification Officer/Assessment Coordinator reports directly to the Director of Teacher Education, working collaboratively with the Dean of the Dreeben School of Education. View Details Bookmark Transfer and Graduate Admissions Counselor AS2302PO Admissions Administrator / Staff The Transfer and Graduate Admissions Counselor is responsible for engaging in recruitment activities and providing direct support to prospective students with applications and application records up to initial university enrollment. As appropriate, position directs students to other university staff to aid with admissions processes. The Transfer and Graduate Admissions Counselor reports to the ... View Details Bookmark Instructor in Athletic Training-Masters Program (Part-Time) UN999PO School of Rehabilitation Sciences University Faculty The School of Rehabilitation Sciences invites part-time faculty candidates for an Instructor in Athletic Training-Masters Program. In all matters, faculty are expected to maintain the highest standards of professional ethics consistent with the UIW Mission. Official duties and responsibilities of part-time faculty members at the university include teaching with service and professional activiti... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 5 6 Next 4301 Broadway, San Antonio, Texas 78209 210-829-6000 • 1-800-749-WORD Back to top © 2019. University of the Incarnate Word. All rights reserved. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
