ly works with securing appropriate documentation from students to ensure rotation compliance. The Administrative Assistant to Pharmacy Practice Dept. and Experiential Education Programs reports to the Assistant De... View Details Bookmark Student Assistant for Student Engagement Center STU1670PO Facilities Events Management Student The Student Assistant for the Student Engagement Center (SEC) assists the SEC Staff with event management, the SEC Information Desk, and the Red’s Pub Check-Out Desk within the Student Engagement Center. The Student Assistant reports to the Events Operating Manager.This is a student position open to current UIW students who may be hired through the Federal Work-Study Program or student employment. View Details Bookmark Accountant AS2262PO Comptroller's Office Administrator / Staff The Accountant position is responsible for performing routine and complex accounting and analytical work requiring professional knowledge of the theory and practice of recording, classifying, examining, analyzing accounting records and financial transactions, and generating and monitoring financial reports. The Accountant position reports to the Accounting Manager. View Details Bookmark Research Associate AS2292PO Feik School of Pharmacy Administrator / Staff The Research Associate is responsible for assisting in faculty-led research, operating and maintaining scientific instrumentation, coordinating research activities, contributing to the teaching and training of students and research personnel, and ensuring compliance with research regulations and procedures for the Department of Pharmaceutical Sciences. The role exercises independent judgment in... View Details Bookmark Administrative Assistant for Student Affairs AS2296PO Rosenberg School of Optometry Administrator / Staff The Administrative Assistant for Student Affairs is responsible for providing administrative support for the Assistant Dean for Student Affairs in the Rosenberg School of Optometry (UIWRS