er the supervision of SNHP faculty an... View Details Bookmark Substitute Teacher Pool - St. Anthony Catholic High School HS415PO St. Anthony Catholic High School High School Positions 04/05/2027 St. Anthony Catholic High School is seeking substitute teachers for the 2025-2026 academic school year. Substitute Teachers report to the Principal and Dean of Student Affairs.St. Anthony Catholic High School prepares young men and women for positions of responsibility and leadership through a college preparatory curriculum based on Catholic values and traditions.This applicant pool will remain... View Details Bookmark Graduate Assistant for Media Relations STU1662PO Communications & Brand Marketing Student 05/15/2027 The Graduate Assistant for Media Relations is responsible for contributions to the University’s athletics website and serving as the primary contact for assigned sports while assisting with other sports. This position will support the communications department by monitoring, updating, editing, and proof-reading recaps, articles, game and year stats, and social media information. The Graduate As... View Details Bookmark Lab Teaching Assistant for Rosenberg School of Optometry (Student Position) STU1653PO Rosenberg School of Optometry Student 05/15/2027 The Lab Teaching Assistant (TA) assists current RSO students with lab tutoring for the following courses: Clinical Optometry I, Clinical Optometry II, Clinical Optometry III, Clinical Optometry IV, Neuroanatomy and any other labs as needed. This position reports to the Director, Student Success.This is a student position open to current UIW 3rd year/4th year Rosenberg School of Optometry students. View Details Bookmark Lead Lab Teaching Assistant STU1652PO Rosenberg School of Optometry Student 05/15/2027 The Lead Lab Teaching Assistant (TA) assists current RSO students with lab tutoring for the following courses: Clinical Optometry I, Clinical Optometry II, Clinical Optometry III, Clinical Optometry IV, Neuroanat