ector of Title IX. This position is funded by the Federal Work-Study program and is open to UIW students who are approved and eligible to participate in the Federal Work-St... View Details Bookmark New Student Programs Student Assistant STU1637PO New Student Programs Student The New Student Programs Office Assistant provides customer service to students, faculty, and staff. The Office Assistant for New Student Programs works in conjunction with New Student Program peer mentors to better serve students and other members of the UIW community. The New Student Programs Office Assistant will report to the Director of New Student Programs. View Details Bookmark Student Assistant for Admissions Office STU1650PO Admissions Student 05/15/2027 The Student Assistant for the Admissions Office assists with all tasks, processes and eventsof the Office of Admissions. The Student Assistant provides excellent customer service to prospective students, their families, and the community as a whole. The Student Assistant reports to the Assistant Director of Campus Events. This is a student position open to current UIW students who may be hired ... View Details Bookmark Graduate Assistant for Women's Tennis STU1644PO Athletics Student 05/15/2027 The Graduate Assistant for Women’s Tennis provides support to the Head Coach in all aspects of academic success, coaching, strength, conditioning, recruiting, planning of practice, organization of team meetings, scheduling and trip management. The Graduate Assistant for Women’s Tennis reports to the Head Coach for Women’s Tennis. This is a student position open to current UIW grauate students. View Details Bookmark Student Special Events Crew Member (Work- Study STU1648PO Facilities Events Management Student 05/15/2027 The Special Events Crew Members assist with daily operations of set up and breakdown of event equipment such as tables, chairs, and platforms, and deliver and transport office and dormitory furniture. The Special Events Crew Member