or of Sports and Wellness in the Club Sports Program.This is a student position open to current UIW graduate students. View Details Bookmark Natatorium Coordinator (Graduate Assistant) STU1618PO Sports & Wellness Student 05/31/2027 The Graduate Assistatant is responsible for operations of the UIWNatatorium: participates in and supervises daily life guard coverage, cleaning, maintenance and repair of equipment and facility (including dressing rooms). The Graduate Assistatant reports to the Director of Sports and Wellness.This is a student position open to UIW graduate students. View Details Bookmark Men's Club Basketball Coach (Graduate Assistant) (Student) STU1617PO Sports & Wellness Student The Men’s Club Basketball Coach (Graduate Assistant) is responsible for coaching the Men’s Club Sports Basketball team during the Fall and Spring semesters. This position reports to the Director of Sports and Wellness in the Club Sports Program.This is a student position open to UIW graduate students. View Details Bookmark Women's Club Basketball Coach (Graduate Assistant) (Student) STU1616PO Sports & Wellness Student The Women’s Club Basketball Coach (Graduate Assistant) is responsible for coaching the Men’s Club Sports Basketball team during the Fall and Spring semesters. This position reports to the Director of Sports and Wellness in the Club Sports Program.This is a student position open to UIW graduate students. View Details Bookmark Student Instructor for Sports and Wellness (Student) STU1615PO Sports & Wellness Student 05/31/2027 The Student Instructor for Sports and Wellness is responsible for teaching classes for Sports and Wellness facilities, including water aerobics, group aerobics, group swim lessons, and individual swim lessons. The Student Instructor for Sports and Wellness reports to the Assistant Director of Sports and Wellness.This is a student position open to current UIW students. View Details Bookmark Personal Trainer for Sports and Wellness (Student Positio