271PO ILA Faye Miller School of Nursing & Health Prof Administrator / Staff The CRNA Program Recruitment and Compliance Specialist will play a pivotal role in driving the growth and success of the CRNA program by effectively managing the recruitment, enrollment and compliance processes from initial inquiries to successful matriculation of graduate registered nurses. The role encompasses building clinical partnerships, marketing and social media engagement, credentialin... View Details Bookmark Research Compliance Coordinator AS2282PO Research & Graduate Education Administrator / Staff The Research Compliance Coordinator is responsible for ensuring compliance with federal and state research regulations, institutional policies, and best practices. This position provides specialized regulatory expertise and administrative support to the UIW research community in support of several research compliance areas, including, but not limited to: protecting human subjects in research; m... View Details Bookmark Interior Design - Student Lab Assistant (2026-27 Academic Year) STU1605PO School of Media & Design Student The Student Lab Assistant for Interior Design assists faculty and staff in their duties to support the daily operations of the Interior Design Department View Details Bookmark Fashion Management - Student Assistant - 2026/2027 STU1604PO School of Media & Design Student The Student Assistant for Fashion Management primarily works as a teaching assistant in Fashion Studio classes and assists faculty and staff with day-to-day tasks as needed by the department. The Student Assistant reports to the Fashion Management Faculty. View Details Bookmark Kinesiology, Sport Management & Wellness Instructor (Part-Time) UN1038PO ILA Faye Miller School of Nursing & Health Prof University Faculty 04/01/2027 The Ila Faye Miller School of Nursing & Health Professions invites part-time faculty candidates for Instructor, Kinesiology, Sport Management, and Wellness. This position will te