ases of a competitive artistic swimming program in accordance with US Collegiate, USA Artistic Swimming and University of Incarnate Word rules and regulations. The Graduate Assistant Artistic Swimming reports the the Head Swim Coach. View Details Bookmark Graduate Assistant - Sports Medicine Administrative Assistant STU1607PO Athletics Student 05/15/2027 Graduate Assistant for the Sports Medicine Department (Athletic Training), performs duties that include: managing the EMR system; managing athletic training rooms, and performing other duties as assigned. The Graduate Assistant Sports Medicine Department (Athletic Training) reports directly to the Associate Director of Athletics-Sports Medicine. View Details Bookmark Student Assistant for Accounts Payable STU1600PO Accounts Payable Student The Student Assistant for Accounts Payable will help support the Accounts Payable Office by performing clerical duties and other duties assigned. The Student Assistant for Accounts Payable reports to Senior Accounts Payable Technician. View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Recruitment-Admissions AS2263PO Admissions Administrator / Staff The Assistant Director of Recruitment-Admissions assists the Director and Associate Director of Admissions with initiatives and objectives to increase outreach and recruitment of prospective FTIC (First Time in College) students. This position’s primary focus will be on recruitment and admissions for UIW’s Broadway Campus programs, which includes traveling 20% of the time. The Assistant Directo... View Details Bookmark Laboratory Student Assistant (Work Study/Student Worker) STU1594PO School of Mathematics, Science & Engineering Student The Laboratory Student Assistant will assist in the weekly operations of biochemistry research and teaching laboratories. Typical duties will include washing and setting-up laboratory glassware, making solutions, performing inventory of laboratory supplies, and assisting biochemistry faculty with other laboratory preparation duties as assigned. The Laboratory Student Assistant will report to th... View Details Bookmark Campus Life Assistant (Work-Study) STU1603PO Campus Engagement Student The Student Assistant for Campus Life works in conjunction with all Campus Life offices and is aware of all services provided by Campus Life, Campus Engagement, and Student Advocacy offices to better serve students and visitors. The Office of Campus Life is a high traffic, high volume, high call area and assistance within all departments is shared to provide a customer-friendly environment to a... View Details Bookmark TEAM RED Campus Engagement Student Assistant (Work-Study) STU1601PO Campus Engagement Student Team Red Work-Study employees support the Office of Campus Engagement by providing customer service to students, faculty, and staff while assisting with the planning and execution of student events. They collaborate with the Campus Life Office and maintain an understanding of campus services and resources to effectively assist the campus community. Work-study employees report directly to the Co... View Details Bookmark UIW Community Clinic Office Assistant STU1597PO School of Rehabilitation Sciences Student The UIW Community Clinic Office Assistant will act as the UIW Community Clinic Floor Manager to assist in supervising physical therapist(s), clinic administrators, students, and patients/clients with all clinic duties.  The UIW Community Clinic Office Assistant reports to the UIW Community Clinic Lead. View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 5 6 Next 4301 Broadway, San Antonio, Texas 78209 210-829-6000 • 1-800-749-WORD Back to top © 2019. University of the Incarnate Word. All rights reserved. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
