alth Center (2547 E. Commerce St. SA. TX... View Details Bookmark Student Assistant for the Artful Worship Program STU1573PO College of Humanities, Arts & Social Sciences Student The Student Assistant for the Artful Worship Program provides vital research and program support for a multi-year, arts-based faith formation initiative centered on the Catholic imagination. The Graduate Assistant reports to the Program Coordinator. View Details Bookmark Front Desk Staff STU1565PO Sports & Wellness Student | The Front Desk Associate (Student Position) provides a welcoming and safe environment for all patrons of sports and wellness facilities, through high-level customer service. The Front Desk Associate reports to the Assistant Director of Sports and Wellness.This applicant pool will remain online for the 2025-2026 academic year and will be used to hire interested students as needed. This is a st... View Details Bookmark Peer Tutor STU1564PO Learning Support Center Student The Peer Tutor provides academic tutoring and/or writing assistance to undergraduate UIW students individually and in groups, as qualified and will perform other center-related duties when not tutoring (see essential functions). Peer Tutors are assigned to specific disciplines based on qualifications. The Peers Tutors report to Director, Learning Support Services. View Details Bookmark Senior Resident Assistant STU1560PO Residence Life & Housing Operations Student The Senior Resident Assistant (SRA) position is a student leader role responsible for providing support and assistance to RLHO Administrators within a housing community comprised of one or more residence hall buildings. This student has been a Resident Assistant and wishes to promote a positive living & learning environment. The Senior Resident Assistant (SRA) reports to a Residence Life Co... View Details Bookmark LSAMP Peer Coach STU1563PO School of Mathematics, Science & Engineering Student The Peer Coach helps and guides students in the NSF 